---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import { docGroups } from '../../lib/docs'
---
<Base title="Documentation" description="Install Hexbot, create bots, connect tools, and run a self-hosted daemon.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:py-16">
    <h1 class="display text-[clamp(2.75rem,7vw,4.25rem)]">Documentation</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-4">Run bots on your own computer, give each one a model and memory, and bring them together in rooms.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-mute">Start with <a href="/docs/install/">Install</a> and <a href="/docs/quick-start/">Quick start</a>. These guides follow the current repository. If a control is missing in your build, check <a href="/docs/updates/">Updates</a>.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl rounded-[20px] bg-wash p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold">Recent changes</h2>
      <p class="mt-2">The full package now includes a native Rust daemon with persistent Pi conversations. Bots can <a href="/docs/rooms/#bots-working-together">ask teammates for help privately</a>, name their sections, and work inside the <a href="/docs/approvals/">Auto sandbox</a>. <a href="/docs/connect/">Hex Connect</a> signs in apps and browsers, and <a href="/docs/updates/">app updates</a> download when you ask and confirm before installing.</p>
    </div>
    {docGroups.map(group => (
      <section class="mt-10" aria-label={group.title}>
        <h2 class="display-sm text-2xl">{group.title}</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-x-8 border-t border-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {group.pages.map(({ title, summary, href }) => (
            <li><a class="group flex h-full flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-line py-5 pr-4" href={href}><span class="text-[1.15rem] font-semibold group-hover:text-accent">{title}</span><span class="text-mute">{summary}</span></a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
    ))}
    <p class="mt-10 text-mute">Contributing? Read <a href="/docs/development/">Run from source</a> and the <a href="https://github.com/The1UNeed/hexbot/tree/main/docs">repository guides</a> for the API, testing, and deployment details.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
